From 3bb11bb6f6e6bedcf32a2de48f4ccce8c322a9d9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 21:17:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(xtask): batch gate runs kernel suites; gate --only and
 --failed

The batch tier runs the camcraft-kernel debug suites. Every gate tier but
test takes --only <step> and --failed <gate-logs/run> to run only some steps.

Fixes #1702

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
